<title>USA: AMEX to list Lilly LEAPS from February 13.</title>
<headline>AMEX to list Lilly LEAPS from February 13.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange (AMEX) said Wednesday it would start trading long term equity anticipation securities, or LEAPS options, on shares of Eli Lilly and Co on Thursday, February 13.</p>
<p>The exchange said the Lilly LEAPS would have strike prices of 70, 90 and 110, with expirations January 1998 and January 1999.</p>
<p>Lilly shares closed up 1-1/2 at 90-1/2 Wednesday.</p>
<p>The AMEX said the specialist unit for the Lilly LEAPS would be Highland Securities Co.</p>
<p>((Derivatives desk, 3124088750/Email: derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
